{"time": 1758725476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300826964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "921676951", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚上加人偶，太恐怖片标配了吧”"}
{"time": 1758725477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415637470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "921676951", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“总不能那个传言是真的吧……”一阵哆嗦"}
{"time": 1758725507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846746148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "921676951", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“现在过去吧？”他拿出手机，“我来打车。”"}
{"time": 1758725538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549454531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "921676951", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行...明天白天去好不好”"}
